   971                                  ; Completed POST tone through the real PIT channel 2 -> port 61h -> speaker
   972                                  ; path.  Count hardware OUT2 transitions so the tone duration follows emulated
   973                                  ; motherboard time instead of an arbitrary host delay loop.
   974                                  post_beep:
