  1019                                  ; Honor the CMOS keyboard-error pause policy after Setup has had its final
  1020                                  ; chance to change it.  A missing/failing keyboard may legitimately stop an
  1021                                  ; old-school AT at POST; disabling the option lets headless/no-keyboard tests
