  1232                                  ; IRQ14 / INT 76h fixed-disk completion handler.  The IBM AT BIOS contract
  1233                                  ; records completion in BDA byte 40:8Eh bit 7.  DOS IDE/ATAPI drivers such as
  1234                                  ; VIDE-CDD use that flag while waiting for the primary-channel interrupt.
  1235                                  ; A slave-PIC interrupt must be ended at both controllers, slave first.
  1236                                  int76:
