  1635                                  ; Runtime keyboard helpers ---------------------------------------------------
  1636                                  ; These helpers operate with DS = BDA_SEG.  They use the same physical
  1637                                  ; controller/keyboard command path POST used; no host-side state is consulted.
  1638                                  
  1639                                  ; AL = byte to send to the keyboard.  Wait for ACK, retry on RESEND.
  1640                                  ; Returns CF set on timeout/error.  Keyboard command responses bypass the
  1641                                  ; 8042 scan-code translator in Keyboard Reality Brick 2.
  1642                                  kbd_runtime_send:
  1643 00000AD5 53                          push bx
  1644 00000AD6 51                          push cx
  1645 00000AD7 52                          push dx
