  4442                                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  4443                                  ; INT 14h - PC/AT asynchronous communications services
  4444                                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  4445                                  ; These services drive the guest-visible 16550A registers.  They do not call a
  4446                                  ; host serial API.  DX selects the BDA-published COM adapter (0..3).
  4447                                  ; Service contract and timeout structure follow the IBM Personal Computer XT
  4448                                  ; Technical Reference BIOS listing (March 1986), pp. 5-132 through 5-137:
  4449                                  ; https://www.minuszerodegrees.net/manuals/IBM/IBM_5155_5160_Technical_Reference_6280089_MAR86.pdf
