  5261                                  ; Cromwell AT CMOS Setup
  5262                                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  5263                                  ; The setup program lives in the system ROM, as it did on late AT-compatible
  5264                                  ; motherboards. CMOS byte 20h is OEM configuration RAM covered by the normal
  5265                                  ; 10h-20h checksum: bit 0 is boot Num Lock, bit 1 selects HDD-first boot,
  5266                                  ; bit 2 selects Fast POST memory test, and bit 3 controls keyboard-error halt.
